# What CI installs, which is the runtime lock plus the linter.
#
# CI used to `pip install pandas numpy scikit-learn joblib pytest ruff` with no versions at
# all, which made the one job that is supposed to catch "it worked on my laptop" the only
# part of the project not pinned. A CI run that resolves whatever is newest can pass on a
# library the image has never seen, or fail on one nobody chose.
#
# Compiled with:
#     uv pip compile requirements-dev.in --generate-hashes --python-version 3.11 \
#         -o requirements-dev.txt
-r requirements.in
ruff==0.16.6
